From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Frank Chang <frank.aka.hao.hao@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:30:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] arm64: dts: rockchip: tinker-edge-r: drop the /chosen
 bootargs

Rockchip's U-Boot 2017.09 merges the kernel DTB's /chosen/bootargs over the extlinux append line (fdt_chosen -> env_update_filter replaces an argument with the same key), so the bootargs set here won over extlinux.conf. Their earlycon=uart8250,mmio32,0xff180000 pointed the 8250 early console at UART0, which neither the loader nor U-Boot sets up; without a baud rate the early console assumes the UART is ready and serial_putc() waits forever for the transmitter to empty. Every boot hung before its first message.

Delete the property, including the one inherited from rk3399-linux.dtsi, so the kernel command line comes from extlinux.conf alone.
---
 .../boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399pro-tinker-edge-r.dtsi  | 13 +++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399pro-tinker-edge-r.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399pro-tinker-edge-r.dtsi
index 2778a2fb7..378432eb4 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399pro-tinker-edge-r.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399pro-tinker-edge-r.dtsi
@@ -46,8 +46,17 @@ aliases {
 	};
 
 	chosen {
-		/* Overridden by the bootloader (extlinux append); kept as a sane default. */
-		bootargs = "earlycon=uart8250,mmio32,0xff180000 console=ttyFIQ0,115200n8 console=tty0 swiotlb=1 coherent_pool=1m";
+		/*
+		 * No bootargs here, and none inherited from rk3399-linux.dtsi.
+		 * Rockchip's U-Boot merges /chosen/bootargs OVER the extlinux
+		 * "append" line (fdt_chosen -> env_update_filter: an argument
+		 * with the same key is replaced), so whatever is set here wins.
+		 * The earlycon on UART0 this node used to carry hung every boot:
+		 * U-Boot only sets up UART2, and the 8250 early console waits
+		 * forever on an uninitialised UART.  The kernel command line
+		 * lives in /boot/extlinux/extlinux.conf alone.
+		 */
+		/delete-property/ bootargs;
 	};
 
 	adc-keys {
